&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML, part of WPP, is a leading creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce, creating connected brands to drive growth. VML is celebrated for its innovative and human first, award-winning work for blue chip client partners including AstraZeneca, Colgate-Palmolive, Dell, Ford, Microsoft, Nestlé, The Coca-Cola Company, and Wendy&#39;s. The agency is recognized by the Forrester Wave™ Reports, as a Leader among Marketing Creative and Content Service Providers, Commerce Services, Global Digital Experience Services, Global Marketing Services and, most recently, Marketing Measurement &amp;amp; Optimization. In addition, VML’s specialist health network, VML Health, is one of the world’s largest and most awarded health agencies. VML’s global network is powered by 26,000 talented people across 55+ markets, with principal offices in Kansas City, New York, Detroit, London, São Paulo, Shanghai, Singapore, and Sydney.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;2714312b-312f-4651-9f88-d8a4e47547bc&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML Enterprise Solutions is growing its technical pre-sales capability to support AWS-led growth across EMEA, with a focus on the UK and Ireland.&amp;nbsp;We are looking for a hands-on technical expert who can prove the value of our AWS solutions through clear demos, high-impact POCs and scalable reference architectures.&amp;nbsp;This role sits between AWS technology and VML delivery, supporting co-sell opportunities by removing technical doubt, proving feasibility and giving clients confidence we can deliver.&amp;nbsp;You will work closely with Alliance Sales, Solution Leads and AWS teams across UKI and EMEA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a technical pre-sales role focused on AWS co-sell across EMEA. You will lead demos, POCs and solution design, supporting opportunities from early engagement through to close.&lt;br&gt;Success is measured through delivery, including POCs completed, conversion to production, quality of architectures and impact on technical win rates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical pre-sales and pursuit support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the technical lead within account teams across AWS opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver client-facing demos and lead proof of concept (POC) engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with AWS Solution Architects and internal stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to RFPs and SOWs by shaping technical content and solution scope&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical discussions and remove blockers to build client confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture and assets&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create reference architectures for common AWS use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable demo environments and technical assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document best practice and stay current with AWS services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure solutions reflect GDPR, UK data residency and EU data sovereignty&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enablement and collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support delivery teams with technical guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share best practice and help build capability across EMEA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain AWS certifications and work closely with AWS technical teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical focus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will bring experience across several of the following areas:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generative AI and machine learning, including Bedrock and SageMaker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data and analytics, including Amazon Marketing Cloud and Clean Rooms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer experience platforms such as Personalize and Connect&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern application development using Lambda, Step Functions and APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integration patterns, including event-driven architecture and microservices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data governance, security and regional compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What good looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering POCs that convert into production work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating architectures that accelerate pursuits and can be reused&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bringing credibility into client conversations and improving win rates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your background&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in technical pre-sales, sales engineering, solution architecture or technical consulting, ideally within a professional services, consultancy, GSI, agency, Big 4 or AWS ProServe-style environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong client-facing sales engineering experience, with a track record of leading technical conversations, shaping demos and POCs, and helping convert technical wins into signed engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident contributing to SOWs, RFPs and proposals, including solution narrative, technical assumptions, deliverables and effort framing in support of account teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on AWS delivery experience, with at least AWS Certified Solutions Architect Associate level certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data, AI/ML and analytics expertise, with practical experience designing or delivering data platforms, analytics pipelines and ML/GenAI workloads on AWS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Credible as a client and partner-facing technical lead, able to communicate complex ideas clearly to senior stakeholders, account teams and AWS field teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of enterprise architecture patterns and how to translate client requirements into practical, scalable technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UK-based with the right to work in the UK and willing to travel across EMEA as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced AWS certifications, such as AWS Solutions Architect Professional or Specialty certifications in Machine Learning, Data Analytics or Security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Amazon Bedrock, generative AI implementations or broader AI use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Amazon Marketing Cloud, advertising technology or marketing technology environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience working for an AWS partner company, directly with AWS, or supporting co-sell motions with AWS UKI and EMEA field teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of EMEA regulatory and compliance frameworks, including GDPR, DORA and UK data protection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional European language capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role positioning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a technical expert role focused on enabling co-sell success. It is not a quota-carrying sales role or a post-sale delivery position. You will build the solutions that prove capability and shape the outcome of AWS-led opportunities across EMEA.&lt;/p&gt;
